/**
 * WITNESS ON REPLAY, EDIT AND SELECT (§7 of `everlore-docs/phases/reply-language.md`).
 *
 * Drives the REAL `memoryService.replayEvent`, `editEvent` and
 * `selectReplayVariant` against an in-memory Mongo and a scripted model: no
 * network, no DB, no real world. It records the extractor inputs, the model
 * bodies, the written update and the curation job, so one view (English copy or
 * native, never mixed) can be asserted exactly.
 *
 * English is untouched: the English cases' calls and writes are frozen from
 * HEAD's code on the same fixture (`HEAD_SNAPSHOT`, generated by running this
 * audit with `--emit` in a detached HEAD worktree) and compared byte for byte.
 *
 *   bun --no-env-file run scripts/witness-replay-audit.ts
 *   bun --no-env-file run scripts/witness-replay-audit.ts --bites
 */
